  "question": {
    "text": "In a mercury thermometer, the ice point (lower fixed point) is marked as $10^{\\circ}$ and the steam point (upper fixed point) is marked as $130^{\\circ}$. At $40^{\\circ} \\mathrm{C}$ temperature, what will this thermometer read?",
