  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\frac{x-10}{130-10}=\\frac{40}{100}$\r\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}{r}\r\n100 x-1000=4800 \\\\\r\n100 x=5800 \\\\\r\nx=58^{\\circ}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$",
